---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
title="Quick Chan | Procurement & Supply Chain Professional"
description="Quick Chan is an MCIPS qualified procurement and supply chain professional helping global businesses build reliable sourcing and manufacturing networks across Asia."
>

<section class="hero">

<p class="eyebrow">
Quick Chan | HYWSource
</p>

<h1>
Helping Global Businesses Build Better Supply Chains.
</h1>

<p class="lead">
I'm Quick Chan, an MCIPS qualified procurement professional with 15+ years of experience helping businesses source better, reduce supply chain risks and develop reliable manufacturing partners across Asia.
</p>

<div class="hero-buttons">

<a class="primary" href="/quickchan-website/about/">
About Quick Chan
</a>

<a class="secondary" href="/quickchan-website/hywsource/">
HYWSource →
</a>

</div>

</section>

<section class="grid">

<div class="card">

<h2>
Procurement
</h2>

<p>
Strategic sourcing, supplier selection, cost optimisation and procurement management.
</p>

<a href="/quickchan-website/experience/">
Learn More →
</a>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>
Case Studies
</h2>

<p>
Real sourcing projects, manufacturing challenges and practical solutions.
</p>

<a href="/quickchan-website/case-studies/">
View Cases →
</a>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>
Insights
</h2>

<p>
Procurement knowledge, supply chain thinking and selected articles published on Substack.
</p>

<a href="/quickchan-website/insights/">
Read Articles →
</a>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>
Work Together
</h2>

<p>
Need sourcing support in China, Taiwan or Vietnam? Let's discuss your project.
</p>

<a href="/quickchan-website/contact/">
Contact →
</a>

</div>

</section>

<style>

.hero{
padding:110px 0 80px;
max-width:900px;
}

.eyebrow{
letter-spacing:2px;
text-transform:uppercase;
font-size:13px;
color:#777;
}

h1{
font-size:64px;
line-height:1.1;
margin:18px 0 30px;
max-width:850px;
}

.lead{
font-size:22px;
line-height:1.8;
max-width:760px;
color:#444;
}

.hero-buttons{
margin-top:45px;
display:flex;
gap:20px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.primary{
background:#111;
color:white;
padding:16px 28px;
border-radius:6px;
text-decoration:none;
}

.secondary{
padding:16px 28px;
border:1px solid #111;
border-radius:6px;
text-decoration:none;
color:#111;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
gap:35px;
margin-top:70px;
}

.card{
padding:35px;
border:1px solid #e5e5e5;
border-radius:12px;
transition:.2s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-4px);
}

.card h2{
margin-top:0;
font-size:28px;
}

.card p{
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
}

.card a{
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:600;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

h1{
font-size:42px;
}

.lead{
font-size:19px;
}

}

</style>

</Layout>